          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Leuchtturm is built from leuchten 'to shine', an inherited Germanic verb related to Licht 'light', and Turm 'tower', which goes back through Old High German turn to Latin turris (EtymDB)."
            }
